  'Vendor performance': { what: 'This vendor\'s scorecard for the last twelve months: on-time delivery, rejected goods, billing accuracy, prices billed above the order, spend, vendor credits and reviews, with each order\'s delivery.', how: 'Add a review (1 to 5, about one aspect, optionally for one order); a rating of 1 or 2 needs a note. Reviews are never edited; withdraw your own if it was wrong.' },
