  'Revenue recognition': { what: 'Which lines of this invoice are recognised over a service period instead of when invoiced, and once posted how far each line\'s schedule has got.', how: 'On a draft, tick a revenue line, set when the service starts, for how many months and how to spread it, and save. Posting sends those lines to deferred revenue; the monthly release run recognises them.' },
